{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1351477-you-enter-a-malfean-bazaar","id":1351477,"title":"You enter a Malfean bazaar...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-28T07:51:59-08:00","id":1351477,"title":"You enter a Malfean bazaar...","content":"You enter Malfeas. Realm of demons. Body of the Primordial king. Prison of the Yozis.<br /> <br /> And what do you find there? <br /> <br /> 1. A bottle of what appears to be an alcoholic drink. Each swig of the drink brings incredible euphoria, bringing with it mood swings. From the most delicious righteous anger, to the most wonderful wallowing of self pity. There only seems to be one bottle, but the dealer seems to have more in the back...<br /> <br /> Edit: although the title said Malfeas, you can put anything. From a shop in the underworld to a street in a fairy freehold. As long as its a place selling weird stuff set in creation, you're good to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-28T08:36:57-08:00","id":1351484,"title":"","content":"2: A tangled web of threads, set across a brass ring. The shopkeep tells you it's a prayer catcher - place it in the mortal world, and the prayers of those nearby will never reach the ears of heaven. It comes with a bottle for patrons to store the captured prayers, to be drunk at a later date. Quite a delicacy in the right Malfean circles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4086-croakamancer","name":"Croakamancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4086_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-28T18:43:25-08:00","id":1351564,"title":"","content":"3. A basket full of mutated bone-grain. Baked under the mad green sun, you spy gnarled thumb-kernals conjoined from sun-baked femur-stalks. Some of them glisten with specks of raw vitriol. The demon vender swears that under prayers spoken to the Yozis for bounty and desolation in equal measure, these alleged artifact plants can cause the vegetation of Malfeas to grow within Creation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12360-guitar-longcat","name":"Guitar Longcat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-30T09:34:11-08:00","id":1351879,"title":"","content":"4) You find a wind-up brass bird, singing beauteous songs that seem to break the heart. Putting it close to your head, you hear the distant ticks of a clock. The bird hasn't needed to be wound up in a year, and its still working.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-30T15:59:48-08:00","id":1351925,"title":"","content":"5) A great cauldron of iron, inlaid with black jade symbols signifying <i>rebirth</i>. The Jadeborn artisan informs you that if a captured raksha is placed in the cauldron, and the vessel heated by a fire lit with certain reagents that grow near the Pole of Earth, over the course of a night and a day the unfortunate fae can be rendered down into raw gossamer. Humans don't usually have much use for gossamer, but the artisan is confident that if applied properly to the soul (you'll want a skilled and trustworthy sorcerer for this), the stuff could be used to restore the raksha's dream-eaten victims!<br /> <br /> They, uh, might not be <i>exactly</i> the same as they once were. But they'll definitely have <i>a</i> personality again, and you can hardly blame them for being a bit traumatized, right? Just make sure you've got the right raksha. He's really not sure what might happen if you don't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T21:05:03-07:00","id":1381851,"title":"","content":"DEATH HONEY<br /> <br /> Several particularly large jars of honey, thick and strong, with a bitter aftertaste. The seller claims that the honey was made from flowers in the shadow lands. He claims that it tastes delicious to ghosts, and palatable to humans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T21:48:11-07:00","id":1381856,"title":"","content":"A map of Bostvade, the Quicksilver Highway. It shifts as you look at it, but the seller says that by timing and placing your entry and exit into the river, one can traverse any layer of Malfeas, though no branches of the river have ever made their way to Cecelyne that he can recall, and he's been selling maps of the Highway since before the Imprisonment was a thousand years old. He boasts that none of his customers have ever come back with complaints!... and you can't tell if he's joking or serious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T13:17:15-07:00","id":1383431,"title":"","content":"A Dance Dance Revolution machine, built at triple-scale, and operated by servants of the Young One, the Penitent Soul of Ligier. It\u2019s powered by batteries made of Yellow Jade, common lead and <i>Theion To</i>, and a mile-long line of First Circle demons snakes through the Malfean cityscape to the grand yurt in which it is kept. Contests can be held for stakes ranging from simple bragging rights, to terms of enforced servitude, to a draught of Chalcanth, rendered from the losing dancer.<br /> <br /> Frequent upkeep of the machine is required, but a highly-trained Decanthrope provides a 10-man maintenance crew, and replacement components are delivered bi-monthly by the time-skewed (read: Exalted Modern) Eclipse Caste trader that first delivered it three years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}